{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52835","headline":"裴将军剑舞赋附歌 · 乔潭","name":"裴将军剑舞赋附歌","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"洸洸武臣，耀雄剑兮清边尘。\n威戎夷兮率土来宾（一作「威远夷兮率来宾」），焉用轻裙之妓女，长袖之才人。\n（见《文苑英华》卷八二）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"乔潭","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_52835.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52835","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}